Default-construct the vectors and only copy when the source is non-empty, avoiding redundant pointer copies for the common empty-field-definition case.

```cpp
FieldBase::FieldBase(const FieldBase &field)
{
    if (!field.values.empty())
    {
        values = field.values;
    }
    if (!field.stringIndexes.empty())
    {
        stringIndexes = field.stringIndexes;
    }
}
```